speechtext:
I have the honour to inform the House that a message has been received from the Senate informing this House that the Senate has passed the following bills, to which the concurrence of this House is desired:
Bill S-12, an Act respecting the Canadian Merchant Service Guild;
Bill S-13, an Act to revive Montilac Ltd. and Socam Ltd.;
Bill S-14, an Act to revive Tremus Industries Limited.
